  ],
  "description": "Repairs r-def-cursor-dao/err-dup-field-append and err-dup-index-append: the second pass failed 3211 because the snapshot sr was open on T, so 'the same step again' was a different fault. Errors read; a new Index named IX_TN (an existing index of T) over N appended with TableDef.Indexes.Append, Errors read; a new Long Field named N appended with TableDef.Fields.Append, Errors read; a snapshot of T opened and CLOSED, Errors read; the two appends again, each followed by its own Errors read; then the Indexes of T (after Refresh) and the Fields of T read. Asks the Number of each duplicate-name failure on its own, in both passes, and what the collections hold afterwards. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
